    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't Be A Baby! is a humorous and action-packed side-scrolling run and gun game with a twist: instead of changing other objects, the player's bottle weapon shoots in different patterns! With a hilarious narrative, players take on the role of Max Murphy, a baby who has finally had enough of his neglectful mother and decides to venture out into the world on his own. As he navigates through the city's nightlife, Max must use his wits and his trusty bottle weapon to defend himself against a variety of colorful enemies, including drunken partygoers, strippers, and other unsavory characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is focused on a boss fight, with four bosses having their own unique levels to battle through. The game also features a skateboarding level and a flying level, adding some variety to the gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is packed with 12 unique songs, a free demo, and 4 4th wall breaking scenes that cut to 3D.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 12 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 5 boss's  with 3 having their own levels.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4 weapons <br>- 1 Skateboarding level <br>\u00a01 Flying level where he is on a drone <br>- 12 Cutscenes <br>- 3 4th wall breaking scenes that cut to 3d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 10 unique songs <br>- Free Demo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/8249d40d190131ff8b671976a68107cd.poster.avif?t=1744697843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/8249d40d190131ff8b671976a68107cd.webm?t=1744697843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/8249d40d190131ff8b671976a68107cd.mp4?t=1744697843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/574f0670e856ed4c74c78606a97e98d8.poster.avif?t=1744697843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/574f0670e856ed4c74c78606a97e98d8.webm?t=1744697843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/574f0670e856ed4c74c78606a97e98d8.mp4?t=1744697843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't Be A Baby! is a humorous and action-packed side-scrolling run and gun game with a twist: instead of changing other objects, the player's bottle weapon shoots in different patterns! With a hilarious narrative, players take on the role of Max Murphy, a baby who has finally had enough of his neglectful mother and decides to venture out into the world on his own. As he navigates through the city's nightlife, Max must use his wits and his trusty bottle weapon to defend himself against a variety of colorful enemies, including drunken partygoers, strippers, and other unsavory characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is focused on a boss fight, with four bosses having their own unique levels to battle through. The game also features a skateboarding level and a flying level, adding some variety to the gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is packed with 12 unique songs, a free demo, and 4 4th wall breaking scenes that cut to 3D.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 12 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 5 boss's  with 3 having their own levels.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4 weapons <br>- 1 Skateboarding level <br>\u00a01 Flying level where he is on a drone <br>- 12 Cutscenes <br>- 3 4th wall breaking scenes that cut to 3d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 10 unique songs <br>- Free Demo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/8249d40d190131ff8b671976a68107cd.poster.avif?t=1744697843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/8249d40d190131ff8b671976a68107cd.webm?t=1744697843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/8249d40d190131ff8b671976a68107cd.mp4?t=1744697843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/574f0670e856ed4c74c78606a97e98d8.poster.avif?t=1744697843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/574f0670e856ed4c74c78606a97e98d8.webm?t=1744697843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1503110/extras/574f0670e856ed4c74c78606a97e98d8.mp4?t=1744697843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
